[{"client_msg_id":"57c04ea9-647d-4b45-a474-eac39dfdcaf1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"fern","ts":"1625495547.328700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NNDq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d92cc3b3-bfe9-4989-bdd7-012b876f3e01","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"WSL2の中からホストのWindows側にアクセスするの、パブリックアクセス扱いなんですよね。Windows側で動くプログラムはデフォルトではプライベートのみ許可になるからDefernderが弾いちゃう。","ts":"1625495511.328500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15672839-0618-4359-a634-33c28d084163","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"Windows Defender ファイアウォールの設定変更なんて滅多にしないので、やり方すぐに忘れてしまうのでメモ。\nWindowsの設定を開いて Defender で検索、Windows Defender ファイアウォールを開いて、左側の Windows Defender ファイアウォールを介したアプリまたは機能を許可をクリック、そして必要なアプリの設定を変更。","ts":"1625495379.326800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YKF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ead96a2-cef7-4675-bc79-3412de70807d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"FW だったか。なるほど…","ts":"1625494883.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bBn4W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c831a682-f1ce-4722-b069-83563997459c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"お、繋がりました！","ts":"1625494868.324400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":3,"users":["UMRAUJY22","U6XP9LZ6V","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bnb5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2e8570d-9381-4911-b605-b91c211b2a52","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"希望が湧いてきた。ありがとうございます！","ts":"1625494761.323300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wvq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"571f73fa-15a9-4179-a737-3babc7b29182","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"お、Windows Defenderの設定変更して VcXsrv の追加オプションに `-ac` を指定したらいけた。","ts":"1625494739.323000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["UMRAUJY22","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f5cvm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8569d25d-d89c-45a0-8837-c6283d004e7f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そして takata さんと同じく設定の変え方がよくわからなくていじくり回している (調べたほうが速い気がしてきた)","ts":"1625494733.322800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8DS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de107b64-258e-449e-acb2-dd20e05eb48b","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"ですね","ts":"1625494687.321700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JfTl4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8cd5558-1d73-4e5f-bb2a-7bd1161ece73","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"172.23 になってますけど、そこは環境によって変わりますかね? うちは 172.20.x.x だった","ts":"1625494678.321400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wZG72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c8d316f-60c6-439e-bf92-ac2c57e110fc","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"うちはESETでしたが気づきにくかったです。","ts":"1625494658.321000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XzP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6cb4382-262a-4d64-ac6c-b196138f9f9b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あーそこで弾かれてる説確かに高そう","ts":"1625494634.320200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3j="}]},{"client_msg_id":"63c2c3a9-2afe-420b-bef8-ba7f0bf03404","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"うちはこれ許可する必要ありました\n```svchost.exe/SharedAccesslocal\tInbound\t172.23.x.x(WSL2IP)\t53\nvcxsrv.exe\tInbound\t172.23.x.x(WSL2IP)\t6000(DISPLAY番号1以降もを振っているなら6001～)```\n","ts":"1625494608.319900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tmKU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e29807c2-0c89-458e-977d-353c7129f2cc","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"Windows Defender ファイヤーウォールの設定、あとから変更するのどうするんだっけ？","ts":"1625494557.319100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GF2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff6c1aac-de0a-45d8-a6ee-57d053874dd8","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"これか？\n\u003chttps://astherier.com/blog/2020/08/run-gui-apps-on-wsl2/\u003e","ts":"1625494508.318300","attachments":[{"fallback":"AsTechLog: WSL2＋Ubuntu 20.04でGUIアプリを動かす | AsTechLog","id":1,"title":"WSL2＋Ubuntu 20.04でGUIアプリを動かす | AsTechLog","title_link":"https://astherier.com/blog/2020/08/run-gui-apps-on-wsl2/","text":"Windows 10のWSL2にインストールしたUbuntu 20.04で、GUIアプリが動くように環境を構築してみました。","thumb_url":"https://astherier.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/2020-08-03-008.png","blocks":null,"ts":1596415800,"service_name":"AsTechLog","service_icon":"https://i2.wp.com/astherier.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/cropped-astherier_com_logo_1024.png?fit=180%2C180\u0026#038;ssl=1","thumb_width":166,"thumb_height":131,"from_url":"https://astherier.com/blog/2020/08/run-gui-apps-on-wsl2/","original_url":"https://astherier.com/blog/2020/08/run-gui-apps-on-wsl2/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fpHx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4360a40b-6029-44f7-9aca-84675e01c0b6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ふーむ、謎だ…","ts":"1625494492.317900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZlpS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a69f6f6-2b89-4825-bac1-a848f8db4ef8","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"だとすると全許可なんでそのまま繋げそうですね。","ts":"1625494367.317700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ymDn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7fc637d-0830-44e3-9c2d-cd91692c31d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"VcXsrv は DisableAC=\"True\" してますね。","ts":"1625494340.316900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f6o+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13c1b1aa-fc64-42c1-be3b-eb61e2b9d150","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"あとはxauth許可するかどうかでVcxsrvの設定が変わることくらいですかね","ts":"1625494302.316200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SidQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76effabe-53d4-418c-96af-1183d687eb3d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ファイアウォールか… WSL 側のネットワークからの接続だけ弾く?","ts":"1625494297.316000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X32K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83256305-06d7-418f-93da-ee1cdfc58280","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"たしかに。私もこれで出てくるのは172.19...です。あと設定したのはWin側ファイアーウォールで許可したくらいだったような。","ts":"1625494221.314900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/RkCc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30923d1a-8eee-46d3-9da2-26af56ae5784","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあとりあえず `resolv.conf` がどうなっているかは今は関係ないです","ts":"1625494166.313800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LxkA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bf2441c-c0eb-4a75-a6bc-655e4811a00f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Windows 自身が外側の NW に対して持ってる IP アドレスだと繋がるんですよね","ts":"1625494112.313400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4QE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02220cf9-e337-47f6-bf2e-a25a823672fb","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"それだとdockerとか外部参照でいろいろ不都合あるので/etc/wsl.confで自動生成きってますね","ts":"1625494111.313300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JyT1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d724b562-b330-4dd3-a6b1-0c63796d75f2","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"今頃自分も試してみたけどthincaさんと同じでつながらない","ts":"1625494067.312200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UB//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e45d81e8-82f9-488f-b0fc-e42b0bcfb6f1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"resolv.conf は WSL が自動生成します","ts":"1625494038.311200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8JgB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38c1e0bb-890c-4417-b708-d85313db2161","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"resolve.conf 8.8.8.8にしてます","ts":"1625493995.310600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HXAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"843894e4-4cbb-4f09-8c72-7e921fc519a8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"172 で始まるやつ","ts":"1625493975.310200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"up7Pq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49d887f0-c946-4035-aba2-2a73d92c131c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、ダメですね… `ip route show default` で出てくる IP は `/etc/resolv.conf` に書かれている IP と同じでした…これだと繋がらないです","ts":"1625493965.310000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2PIR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5db09e10-8c2d-4318-bec4-d88552ba6e6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おお","ts":"1625493911.309200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QuiH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e826314f-701a-4cba-b982-8e826c1a72a1","type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"私は\n``` export DISPLAY=$(ip route show default | awk '{print $3 }'):0.0```\nしてますね。","ts":"1625493896.308900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ihnW+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35321ec1-aa93-4eee-b3e3-30466afd4b88","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"gvim.exe だw","ts":"1625493837.308600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ywU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d316571a-75a8-40d0-92dc-12f6e7608e9a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"(Cygwin から Win32 版の gvim を起動するときのくせで…)","ts":"1625493741.308200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9yw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"276ed0aa-e067-4a53-8672-55365d931ca8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(今は関係ないけど gvim は勝手に fork するから `\u0026amp;` は不要そう)","ts":"1625493661.307400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qVhC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be3026b1-0d6e-4e14-b51f-9095a0f99010","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`/etc/resolv.conf` に書かれている IP だと繋がらなかったですね","ts":"1625493515.306800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKx7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b3f2960-f659-4a4b-92ec-5a9583c3e60a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"```export DISPLAY=$(cat /etc/resolv.conf | grep nameserver | awk '{print $2}'):0```","ts":"1625490895.306300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wpf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"900f7a73-f621-415b-9797-c683d51a7a01","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"これで行けそう？\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/ryoi084/items/0dff11134592d0bb895c#%E8%BF%BD%E8%A8%98\u003e","ts":"1625490879.305900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: WSL2におけるVcXsrvの設定 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"WSL2におけるVcXsrvの設定 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ryoi084/items/0dff111345